Kevin Hart breaks his silence after his  crash as the newly released CHP report  reveals what caused the horrific  accident the roof and the cars pretty  photo the startling 35 page report  includes 32 photos of Kevin's mangled  1970 Plymouth Barracuda you can see the  crushed roof and shattered windshield  according to the investigation Kevin's  friend Jared Stanton black was driving  when his quote reckless sudden and rapid  acceleration forced him to lose control  of the vehicle Jarrett's fiance Rebecca  Brock Sturman was next to him Kevin was  in the back which had been quote  converted into a storage area and no  longer actually had seats the report  says that black was not under the  influence of drugs or alcohol it also  states that no one was wearing their  seatbelts properly and it also mentions  that after the crash Kevin quote exited  the vehicle and left the scene of the  collision after the report revealed  Kevin's friend caused the crash the  comedian released a brief statement  through his attorney quote I have  nothing but love for Jared and wish him  and Rebecca a speedy recovery as for  Kevin's recovery a source tells et he is  quote not planning to go back to work  full-time until the first of the year  we're told Kevin fractured his spine in  three places our source says the 40 year  old was hospitalized for ten days after  the crash and then was transferred to a  rehabilitation facility he recently  returned home where he continues his  physical therapy also this week Kevin  put in two hours of work for promos for  the upcoming Jumanji sequel we talked to  his co-star Aquafina today Kevin's great  man yeah we just saw me the other day  and he's his own funny song  [Music]  [Applause]
 

